2. DATA (all files in data/)

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit. Please cite the accompanying article (see README.md).

Notes on third-party sources:
- Citation counts in Journals_2026_clean.csv were hand-collected by research
  assistants from Google Scholar (annual snapshots, 2014-2026).
- Files in data/cache/ derived from OpenAlex (openalex_paper_matches.rds,
  network_citation_data.rds, network_paper_metrics.rds, citing_field_data.rds,
  citing_field_linked.rds) build on the OpenAlex database, which is released
  under CC0 (https://openalex.org).
- repec_author_data.rds contains aggregate author-level statistics derived
  from RePEc.
- conference_parsed_data.rds and Conference_Papers.xlsx contain bibliographic
  facts (titles, authors, sessions) transcribed from publicly posted EHA and
  EHS conference programmes; source URLs are listed in README.md.
